            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/ground+states"} ground states
            with
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/anyon"} anyonic
            properties, such as of
            = succeed "." do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/fractional+quantum+Hall+systems"} fractional quantum Hall systems
          %p
            The issue is that the strongly-coupled electron dynamics, that is thought to be responsible for the
            = succeed "," do
