          %p
            This super-Laughlin wavefunction unifies the basic Laughlin state
            %a.maruku-eqref{:href => "#eq:BasicLaughlinState"} (1)
            with the basic Moore&amp;Read-state
            %a.maruku-eqref{:href => "#eq:BasicMooreReadState"} (2)
            in the sense of
