          %p To re-amplify how the “statistics” matches across this transformation:
          %p
          .num_remark
            %h6 Remark
            %p
              The
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Pfaffian"} Pfaffian
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
