            %p
              But also the
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Vandermonde+determinant"} Vandermonde determinant
              changes sign when swapping pairs of variables (see
              = succeed ")." do
                %a{:href => "Vandermonde+determinant#SkewSymemtryUnderSwappingVariables"} there
            %p This means that:
            %ol
              %li
                %p
                  for odd filling fraction
                  = succeed ":" do
                    %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
