            %p
              %strong (supersymmetric excitations of the RM state)
              %br/
              Analogous analysis shows &amp;lbrack;
              %a{:href => "#GromovMartinecRyu20"}> Gromov, Martinec &amp; Ryu 2020
              \&amp;rbrack; that also the
              %em excitations
              of the Moore-Read state should come in
              = succeed "-pairs" do
